   428	### 2.5 Prop RB (relativisation barrier for small fixed families) [proved, for a listed class of inputs]
   429	
   430	**Setting.**
   431	- A one-level design 𝔇 is given by Φ fixed pairs (f_i, g_i), with devices allowed, and special-q targets ℓ ∈ J.
