   436	  ΦW = N^{o(ν)}.
   437	
   438	**Input class 𝒦.** The class consists of the following statements, applied to the integer set 𝒮 at sizes x ≥ X_r/C.
   439	- (ii) upper bounds #(𝒮 ∩ I) ≤ U(I): DS-U, L2_fam, Rankin, Brun–Titchmarsh-type.
