   507	  Σ_{b≥1} −log(1 − 2^{−b}) < 1.25. So **log Φ_a(r) ≤ φ(a)log r + 1.25** (critic's fix; my draft used
   508	  (r + 1)^{φ(a)}, whose ratio log(r + 1)/log r could push ε above 1).
   509	- For a | e, φ(a) ≤ φ(e). So every piece has log-size ≤ ε_e·t + 1.25 with **ε_e := φ(e)/e** (resp. φ(2e)/e for
   510	  r^e + 1). Since t = e log r − O(1), we have ε_e ≤ 1 + O(1/t).
