  Σ_{m′≤Q} Σ_{(a,m′)=1} |Σ a_F e(aF/m′)|² ≤ (K + Q²)Σ|a_F|².
  - Montgomery–Vaughan, Mathematika 20 (1973), Thm 1 (in the form N + δ^{−1}).
  - The sharp K − 1 + Q² is due to Selberg and to Montgomery–Vaughan (with P. Cohen); see Montgomery,
